  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/j0kr2K4m6y6bcMJT9Bcizq8EqTsVhLhTP8KVplDTnNM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\overline{(A+\\overline{B})+\\overline{C}}=\\overline{A+\\overline{B}} \\cdot C=(\\overline{A} \\cdot B \\cdot C) \\\\\n& \\therefore y=1 \\\\\n& \\text { if } A=0, B=1, C=1\n\\end{aligned}\\)\nFor rest of all cases \\(Y=O\\)\nTotal cases \\(=8\\)\n\\(\\therefore\\) Ans \\((8-1)=7\\)",
